  "transcript": {
    "text": "Good afternoon everyone, and welcome to today's community space. Our topic is water. Many families in our block have gone three days without a single drop from the tap. People are buying jerrycans from vendors for 200 shillings each, and for a family of five that is simply too much. The caretaker says a pipe is broken, but nobody from the water company has come to fix it. We have written letters, we have called the number on the bill, and we are still waiting. Today we want to hear your experiences, and agree together on what we should ask the county office to do.",
